{"openapi": "3.1.0", "info": {"title": "PythonGetaway - MT5 Gateway", "description": "API HTTP sobre MetaTrader 5: extraccion de datos y trading manual.\n\n**Tiempos**: MT5 devuelve epochs medidos en la hora del SERVIDOR del broker. Cada campo temporal se expone como `xxx` (epoch entero) y `xxx_iso` (ISO-8601 sin sufijo de zona, porque no es UTC sino hora de servidor).\n\n**Errores**: todos comparten la forma `{\"error\": {\"code\": ..., \"message\": ..., \"mt5_code\": ..., \"detail\": ...}}`.\n\n**Ordenes**: un HTTP 200 con `success: false` significa que MT5 recibio la peticion y la rechazo. El motivo esta en `retcode_name`.", "version": "1.0.0"}, "paths": {"/": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Indice del gateway", "operationId": "root__get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Root  Get"}}}}}}}, "/health": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Estado del gateway y del terminal", "description": "No requiere conexion: sirve para saber SI hay conexion.\n\nEs el unico endpoint que nunca devuelve 5xx por estar desconectado.", "operationId": "health_health_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Health Health Get"}}}}}}}, "/account": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Datos completos de la cuenta", "description": "Balance, equity, margen, apalancamiento, divisa, tipo de cuenta...\n\n`trade_mode` 0=DEMO 1=CONTEST 2=REAL (tambien como `trade_mode_name`).", "operationId": "account_account_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Account Account Get"}}}}}}}, "/terminal": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Datos del terminal MT5", "description": "Build, rutas, permisos (trade_allowed, dlls_allowed), ping, trafico...", "operationId": "terminal_terminal_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Terminal Terminal Get"}}}}}}}, "/version": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Version de la API de MetaTrader5", "operationId": "version_version_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Version Version Get"}}}}}}}, "/config": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Configuracion efectiva del gateway", "description": "Lo que el gateway tiene cargado. Nunca expone la contrasena.", "operationId": "gateway_config_config_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Gateway Config Config Get"}}}}}}}, "/last-error": {"get": {"tags": ["account"], "summary": "Ultimo error de la libreria MT5", "operationId": "last_error_last_error_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Last Error Last Error Get"}}}}}}}, "/symbols": {"get": {"tags": ["symbols"], "summary": "Lista de simbolos del broker", "description": "Con `names_only=false` y sin `group` esto devuelve MUCHOS megas -- el\nbroker de prueba expone >12.000 simbolos. Filtra siempre que puedas.", "operationId": "list_symbols_symbols_get", "parameters": [{"name": "group", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Filtro estilo MT5, admite comodines. Ej: `*USD*`, `*,!*EUR*` (todos menos los que lleven EUR).", "title": "Group"}, "description": "Filtro estilo MT5, admite comodines. Ej: `*USD*`, `*,!*EUR*` (todos menos los que lleven EUR)."}, {"name": "only_visible", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "boolean", "description": "true = solo los que estan en Market Watch.", "default": false, "title": "Only Visible"}, "description": "true = solo los que estan en Market Watch."}, {"name": "names_only", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "boolean", "description": "true = solo nombres (rapido). false = especificacion completa de cada simbolo (pesado: son miles).", "default": true, "title": "Names Only"}, "description": "true = solo nombres (rapido). false = especificacion completa de cada simbolo (pesado: son miles)."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response List Symbols Symbols Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/symbols/total": {"get": {"tags": ["symbols"], "summary": "Numero total de simbolos", "operationId": "symbols_total_symbols_total_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Symbols Total Symbols Total Get"}}}}}}}, "/symbols/{symbol}": {"get": {"tags": ["symbols"], "summary": "Especificacion completa de un simbolo", "description": "Digitos, punto, spread, volumenes min/max/step, margen, swaps, sesion,\nmodo de llenado permitido, divisas base/beneficio... todo lo que MT5 sabe.\n\nSelecciona el simbolo en Market Watch si aun no lo estaba.", "operationId": "symbol_info_symbols__symbol__get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Symbol Info Symbols  Symbol  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/symbols/{symbol}/select": {"post": {"tags": ["symbols"], "summary": "Anadir o quitar un simbolo del Market Watch", "description": "Un simbolo que no esta en Market Watch no devuelve cotizaciones ni velas.\nLos endpoints de lectura ya lo seleccionan solos; esto es control manual.", "operationId": "select_symbol_symbols__symbol__select_post", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "enable", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "boolean", "default": true, "title": "Enable"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Select Symbol Symbols  Symbol  Select Post"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/tick/{symbol}": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Ultimo tick (cotizacion actual)", "description": "bid, ask, last, volume, spread calculado y hora del tick.", "operationId": "last_tick_market_tick__symbol__get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Last Tick Market Tick  Symbol  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/ticks": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Ultimo tick de varios simbolos a la vez", "description": "Una sola llamada en lugar de N. Los simbolos que fallen se reportan en\n`errors` en vez de tumbar la peticion entera.", "operationId": "last_ticks_market_ticks_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbols", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "Nombres separados por coma. Ej: `EURUSD,GBPUSD,USDJPY`", "title": "Symbols"}, "description": "Nombres separados por coma. Ej: `EURUSD,GBPUSD,USDJPY`"}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Last Ticks Market Ticks Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/candles/{symbol}": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Velas OHLCV por posicion (las N mas recientes)", "description": "La vela de indice 0 es la que se esta formando AHORA y cambia a cada tick.\n\nSi vas a tomar decisiones sobre velas cerradas, usa `include_current=false`\n(equivale a pedir desde `start_pos=1`).", "operationId": "candles_from_pos_market_candles__symbol__get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "timeframe", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1", "default": "M15", "title": "Timeframe"}, "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1"}, {"name": "count", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "description": "Numero de velas.", "default": 500, "title": "Count"}, "description": "Numero de velas."}, {"name": "start_pos", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "0 = la vela EN CURSO (aun sin cerrar). 1 = la ultima vela cerrada.", "default": 0, "title": "Start Pos"}, "description": "0 = la vela EN CURSO (aun sin cerrar). 1 = la ultima vela cerrada."}, {"name": "include_current", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "boolean", "description": "false = descarta la vela en formacion. Util para no operar con una vela incompleta.", "default": true, "title": "Include Current"}, "description": "false = descarta la vela en formacion. Util para no operar con una vela incompleta."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Candles From Pos Market Candles  Symbol  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/candles/{symbol}/from": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Velas OHLCV desde una fecha", "operationId": "candles_from_market_candles__symbol__from_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "timeframe", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1", "default": "M15", "title": "Timeframe"}, "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1"}, {"name": "from_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor).", "title": "From Epoch"}, "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor)."}, {"name": "count", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "default": 500, "title": "Count"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Candles From Market Candles  Symbol  From Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/candles/{symbol}/range": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Velas OHLCV entre dos fechas", "operationId": "candles_range_market_candles__symbol__range_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "timeframe", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1", "default": "M15", "title": "Timeframe"}, "description": "Timeframe: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6, M10, M12, M15, M20, M30, H1, H2, H3, H4, H6, H8, H12, D1, W1, MN1"}, {"name": "from_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor).", "title": "From Epoch"}, "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor)."}, {"name": "to_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor).", "title": "To Epoch"}, "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor)."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Candles Range Market Candles  Symbol  Range Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/ticks/{symbol}/from": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Ticks crudos desde una fecha", "operationId": "ticks_from_market_ticks__symbol__from_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "from_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor).", "title": "From Epoch"}, "description": "Epoch en segundos (hora de servidor)."}, {"name": "count", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "default": 1000, "title": "Count"}}, {"name": "flags", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "ALL | INFO | TRADE. ALL devuelve todos los ticks.", "default": "ALL", "title": "Flags"}, "description": "ALL | INFO | TRADE. ALL devuelve todos los ticks."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Ticks From Market Ticks  Symbol  From Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/ticks/{symbol}/range": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Ticks crudos entre dos fechas", "operationId": "ticks_range_market_ticks__symbol__range_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "from_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "title": "From Epoch"}}, {"name": "to_epoch", "in": "query", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "title": "To Epoch"}}, {"name": "flags", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string", "description": "ALL | INFO | TRADE", "default": "ALL", "title": "Flags"}, "description": "ALL | INFO | TRADE"}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Ticks Range Market Ticks  Symbol  Range Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/market/book/{symbol}": {"get": {"tags": ["market"], "summary": "Profundidad de mercado (DOM / Level II)", "description": "Suscribe el simbolo al libro, lee y devuelve los niveles.\n\nMuchos brokers de Forex retail NO publican profundidad: en ese caso\n`entries` viene vacio y `subscribed` indica si la suscripcion se acepto.\nNo es un error del gateway.", "operationId": "market_book_market_book__symbol__get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Market Book Market Book  Symbol  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/positions": {"get": {"tags": ["positions"], "summary": "Posiciones abiertas", "description": "`symbol` y `group` son mutuamente excluyentes: si mandas los dos, manda\n`symbol`. `profit` ya viene neto de swap? No: `profit` es el flotante SIN\nswap ni comision -- esos van en sus propios campos.", "operationId": "list_positions_positions_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Filtrar por simbolo exacto.", "title": "Symbol"}, "description": "Filtrar por simbolo exacto."}, {"name": "group", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Filtro con comodines. Ej: `*USD*`", "title": "Group"}, "description": "Filtro con comodines. Ej: `*USD*`"}, {"name": "magic", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Filtrar por magic number (se aplica en el gateway).", "title": "Magic"}, "description": "Filtrar por magic number (se aplica en el gateway)."}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response List Positions Positions Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/positions/total": {"get": {"tags": ["positions"], "summary": "Numero de posiciones abiertas", "operationId": "positions_total_positions_total_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Positions Total Positions Total Get"}}}}}}}, "/positions/{ticket}": {"get": {"tags": ["positions"], "summary": "Una posicion por ticket", "operationId": "get_position_positions__ticket__get", "parameters": [{"name": "ticket", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "title": "Ticket"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Get Position Positions  Ticket  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/orders": {"get": {"tags": ["orders"], "summary": "Ordenes pendientes activas", "description": "Solo ordenes VIVAS (limit/stop aun no activadas). Las ya ejecutadas o\ncanceladas estan en `/history/orders`.", "operationId": "list_orders_orders_get", "parameters": [{"name": "symbol", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Symbol"}}, {"name": "group", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Filtro con comodines. Ej: `*USD*`", "title": "Group"}, "description": "Filtro con comodines. Ej: `*USD*`"}, {"name": "magic", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Magic"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response List Orders Orders Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/orders/total": {"get": {"tags": ["orders"], "summary": "Numero de ordenes pendientes", "operationId": "orders_total_orders_total_get", "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object", "title": "Response Orders Total Orders Total Get"}}}}}}}, "/orders/{ticket}": {"get": {"tags": ["orders"], "summary": "Una orden pendiente por ticket", "operationId": "get_order_orders__ticket__get", "parameters": [{"name": "ticket", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": {"type": "integer", "title": "Ticket"}}], "responses": {"200": {"description": "Successful Response", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true, "title": "Response Get Order Orders  Ticket  Get"}}}}, "422": {"description": "Validation Error", "content": {"application/json": {"schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}, "/history/orders": {"get": {"tags": ["history"], "summary": "Ordenes historicas (ejecutadas, canceladas, expiradas)", "operationId": "history_orders_history_orders_get", "parameters": [{"name": "from_epoch", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "description": "Epoch s. Por defecto: hace 30 dias.", "title": "From Epoch"}, "description": "Epoch s. Por defecto: hace 30 dias."}, {"name": "to_epoch", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "descr